<title>USA: DSG International Dutch auction results.</title>
<headline>DSG International Dutch auction results.</headline>
<dateline>DULUTH, Ga. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSG International Ltd said on Monday based on preliminary results, about 1.05 million shares were tendered under its Dutch auction tender offer.</p>
<p>The offer, for up to 850,000 shares of its ordinary shares, expired on December 13, the company said.</p>
<p>DSG said it would buy at $14.50 per share 850,000 shares plus another 153,640 shares, for a total of 1,003,640 of the shares tendered.</p>
<p>Some proration might be required, DSG said.</p>
</text>
